{"id":1121202,"name":"리산드라·심문 II","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"리산드라·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1121202]}],"trial":{"trial_id":121202,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2025-06-24 14:00:00","diary1":"거금을 투자해 제작한 화이트 샌드 묘굴 테마 몰입식 방 탈출 카페에 맞선 리산드라는 신속하게 본업 모드에 돌입해, 당신과 함께 가장 까다로운 장치 해제에 착수했다.\n　　다만, 전단에 적힌 문구 '시범 운영'을 잊지 말아야 한다.","diary2":"당신과 리산드라는 완벽한 호흡으로 장치를 해제했고, 이 과정에서 점차 신뢰를 쌓아갔다.\n　　시범 운영 중이었던 탓에 기계에 갑작스러운 고장이 발생했다. 당신이 모래에 빠지자 리산드라가 처음으로 침착함을 잃고 감정을 드러냈다. 손바닥 위의 모래 먼지 묻은 동전을 보며, 당신은 그녀에 대한 심문을 서둘러 진행해야 겠다고 생각했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260745,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260746,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":221202022,"next":